From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LucasTHCR <lucas@empireblocks.de>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 06:55:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Backport Moonrise fixes and chunk system improvements from
 26.3

- Region file I/O no longer deep copies the chunk NBT for every read callback
- Unloading chunks serialises their sections without copying them first
- The full chunk task loads the entity chunk without entering the ticket lock
- Delayed ticket updates lock each lock region once instead of once per ticket
- Unloaded chunk holders are removed from the broadcast set
- Async ticket update check was inverted
- Villagers only consider POIs within vanilla's 48 block radius (Moonrise #223)
- The player chunk loader iterates in euclidean order again
- IntegerProperty id lookup clamps against max - min

